====================

e2e/fixtures/pic_programmer/
  Copied from the KiCad source tree, demos/pic_programmer (KiCad 10.99, fork branch web-api),
  with the *-backups directory and cache files dropped. Two-sheet hierarchical schematic
  (pic_programmer.kicad_sch -> pic_sockets.kicad_sch), a routed two-layer board, a project
  symbol library and a footprint library with 3D models.

